  "details": "Recently an update was pushed out that automatically recalculates the render resolution based on the window size, so resizing the game window or going in and out of fullscreen doesn't display at the wrong resolution. \n\nSince this update, VRChat will now drop all the way to to **0 FPS** when moving or resizing the application window. This can interfere with Udon logic, causes video players to stutter or freeze, can cause disconnects, and may even interfere with a world's networking if the player doing this is instance master.",
